  "Southern Hound": "The Southern Hound was a large, slow and deep-voiced English scent hound built to work a trail methodically. Its reconstructed ancestry combines Talbot-type hounds with St Hubert influence. Its legacy is enormous, feeding Beagles, Foxhounds, setters, terriers and many later British scent-hound lines.",
